# Forked Repository Verification

## Curl Command

```bash
curl -s https://api.github.com/repos/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPOSITORY
```

## Terminal Output

```json
{
  "name": "YOUR-REPOSITORY",
  "full_name": "YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPOSITORY",
  "fork": true,
  "parent": {
    "full_name": "ibm-developer-skills-network/mcino-Introduction-to-Git-and-GitHub"
  }
}
```

The `"fork": true` field confirms that the repository is a fork, and the `"parent"` field shows that it was forked from:

```text
ibm-developer-skills-network/mcino-Introduction-to-Git-and-GitHub
```
